{"t":1787899520219,"event":{"type":"agent:critique","iteration":0,"defects":["Text critic (severity=medium): I'll review this Account Settings panel design critically against the fidelity bar and design system standards.\n\n---\n\n## Analysis\n\n### Fidelity Check\n- **Color palette**: Dark theme with #0f172a (slate-900) panel, #1e293b (slate-800) inputs, #6366f1 (indigo-500) button — **not grayscale**, real colors applied\n- **Shadows**: 4 shapes have shadows (panel, 2 inputs, button) — **passes**\n- **Gradients**: 0/12 shapes — **missing on hero/CTA** (the button could use one)\n- **Content**: Real names and emails, no \"Lorem ipsum\" — **passes**\n- **Type scale**: 14px/16px/24px — somewhat limited range\n\n### Critical Issues Found\n\n**Input Field Architecture Breakdown**\nThe \"DisplayNameInput\" and \"EmailInput\" shapes have **0 width** (0×48). This is a structural failure — they cannot render as visible inter","VLM critic (score=4/10, severity=medium):","  - [high] Add proper input field styling: visible borders (gray-600), background color (slate-800), rounded corners (8px), and focus rings (indigo-500) to make fields look interactive and not like static text","  - [high] Establish consistent 8px grid alignment: flush-left all content to 24px margin, set vertical rhythm with 24px between field groups and 8px between label-input pairs","  - [high] Implement proper type hierarchy: labels 12px/500/gray-400, values 14px/400/white, title 20px/600 with -0.025em tracking","  - [med] Add button states and secondary action: improve primary button contrast (indigo-500→600), add hover/active/disabled states, and include 'Cancel' ghost button","  - [med] Fix viewport context: change white background to gray-50, center card with 40px+ margin, and add layered shadow (0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.2)) for professional elevation"],"validation":{"totalShapes":12,"textShapes":6,"cardShapes":0,"textShapesWithWeight":4,"cardShapesWithShadow":0,"autoLayoutContainers":6},"textSeverity":"medium","vlmSeverity":"medium","vlmScore":4}}
